/-!
# Class algebra: union of, intersection of, disjoint union of

Wikidata records class-algebraic relationships with `P2737` (union of) and
`P2738` (disjoint union of).  This module gives executable checkers for those
relationships *relative to the knowledge base* (an open-world reading: the
instance-side conditions are checked on the entities the knowledge base knows
about) together with exactness theorems.
-/

